|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|a_0))^0),-a_1^2*a_2+a_0*a_1*a_3,-a_1*a_2^2+a_1^2*a_3,-a_1^2*a_3+a_0*a_1*a_4,-|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|a_1*a_2*a_3+a_1^2*a_4,-a_1*a_3^2+a_1*a_2*a_4}                                |
