|i2 : P4 := QQ[t_0..t_4]                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = QQ[t ..t ]                                                              |
|         0   4                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : P5 := QQ[u_0..u_5]                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = QQ[u ..u ]                                                              |
|         0   5                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : time psi = abstractRationalMap(P4,P5,f)                                 |
| -- used 0.00042865s (cpu); 0.000426806s (thread); 0s (gc)                   |
|                                                                             |
