===========

This option accepts a *note Boolean: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean, value. Set this to
false if you don't want to get the certification message from *note Certify:
Certify,.

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : f = toMap vars(QQ[x_0..x_2]);               |
|                                                 |
|o1 : RingMap QQ[x ..x ] <-- QQ[x ..x ]           |
|                 0   2          0   2            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
