|                                                                             |
|o1 : RationalMap (cubic rational map from 8-dimensional subvariety of PP^11  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|to PP^8)                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : time p = point source f                                                 |
| -- used 0.243328s (cpu); 0.207759s (thread); 0s (gc)                        |
