  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the dimension of the projective
        space
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the i-th case in the
        classification for P^n (for instance, if n=5 then 1<=i<=39)
