      * a *note rational map: RationalMap,, an example of quadro-quadric
        Cremona transformation over K, according to the classifications given
        in the paper Quadro-quadric Cremona transformations in low dimensions
        via the JC-correspondence (see
        https://aif.centre-mersenne.org/item/AIF_2014__64_1_71_0/ ), by Pirio
        and Russo.

