|                      -x*t,                                    |
|                                                               |
|                      -x*u,                                    |
|                                                               |
|                      -x*v                                     |
|                     }                                         |
|                                                               |
|o1 : RationalMap (Cremona transformation of PP^5 of type (2,2))|
