RationalMap ^** Ideal -- inverse image via a rational map
*********************************************************

  * Operator: *note ^**: (Macaulay2Doc)^_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        phi^** I
  * Inputs:
      * phi, a *note rational map: RationalMap,
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a homogeneous ideal in the
        coordinate ring of the target of phi
  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, the ideal of the closure of the
        inverse image of V(I) via phi

