|                             2                                               |
|                      x*z - u ,                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                             2                                               |
|                      x*y - t ,                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                      - z*t + u*v,                                           |
|                                                                             |
|                      - y*u + t*v,                                           |
|                                                                             |
|                      t*u - x*v                                              |
|                     }                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : RationalMap (Cremona transformation of PP^5 of type (2,2))              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : K := frac(QQ[vars(0..5)]); phi = phi ** K                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = -- rational map --                                                      |
|     source: Proj(frac(QQ[a..f])[x, y, z, t, u, v])                          |
|     target: Proj(frac(QQ[a..f])[x, y, z, t, u, v])                          |
|     defining forms: {                                                       |
|                             2                                               |
|                      y*z - v ,                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                             2                                               |
|                      x*z - u ,                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                             2                                               |
|                      x*y - t ,                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                      - z*t + u*v,                                           |
|                                                                             |
|                      - y*u + t*v,                                           |
