segre -- Segre embedding
************************

  * Usage: 
        segre phi 
        segre R
  * Inputs:
      * phi, a *note rational map: RationalMap,, with source a closed
        subvariety $X\subseteq\mathbb{P}^{n_1}\times\mathbb{P}^{n_2}\times\
        cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{n_k}$ of a product of projective spaces
      * R, a *note quotient ring: (Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,, or a *note
        polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, the coordinate ring of
        the subvariety $X\subseteq\mathbb{P}^{n_1}\times\mathbb{P}^{n_2}\times\
        cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{n_k}$
  * Outputs:
